<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 100 bln yen into market -- traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 100 bln yen into market -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) injected a net 100 billion yen into the money market on Wednesday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The injection left the market with a surplus of 300 billion yen, they said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8570</p>
